WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.557
Unit seventeen. Bullying and Cyberbullying!

2
00:00:04.508 --> 00:00:08.329
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.379 --> 00:00:11.902
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.952 --> 00:00:16.334
Today we learn about Bullying and Cyberbullying. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.066 --> 00:00:20.500
Bullying. Say it with me. Bullying!

6
00:00:23.997 --> 00:00:27.797
Cyberbullying. Say it with me. Cyberbullying!

7
00:00:31.306 --> 00:00:35.272
Bystander. Say it with me. Bystander!

8
00:00:38.757 --> 00:00:42.541
Upstander. Say it with me. Upstander!

9
00:00:46.039 --> 00:00:49.406
Report. Say it with me. Report!

10
00:00:52.905 --> 00:00:56.588
Screenshot. Say it with me. Screenshot!

11
00:01:00.098 --> 00:01:03.531
Block. Say it with me. Block!

12
00:01:07.034 --> 00:01:11.500
Trusted adult. Say it with me. Trusted adult!

13
00:01:14.996 --> 00:01:25.190
Bullying is hurting someone again and again. Cyberbullying happens online. An upstander helps instead of being a bystander: take a screenshot, block, report it, and tell a trusted adult.

14
00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:26.398
I can do that too!

15
00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:33.342
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:33.392 --> 00:01:34.542
Bystander!

17
00:01:35.602 --> 00:01:40.936
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:40.986 --> 00:01:42.136
Block!

19
00:01:42.953 --> 00:01:49.583
Did you know? Saving evidence, like a screenshot, can help adults stop online bullying!

20
00:01:49.633 --> 00:01:51.700
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:59.900
Think and answer. What can you do if you see cyberbullying?

22
00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:01.100
Great answer!

23
00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:07.253
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:07.303 --> 00:02:09.891
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

